00%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">기계시스템공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응용수학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전자공학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">컴퓨터공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">토목공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">화학소재융합학부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">담당업무 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">정서 및 학습지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">멘토링 일지 작성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">활동일지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">보고서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">□ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">활동기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2017. 9</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">~ 2017.12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-